        "accreditation_text": "Master of Business Administration (MBA) program aims at providing modern and better education in business, preparing students as well-trained business professionals to meet the needs of the national and international business.",
        "about": "Master of Business Administration (MBA) program aims at providing modern and better education in business, preparing students as well-trained business professionals to meet the needs of the national and international business. Through this program, students will develop their ability to understand necessary techniques for dealing with the economic, social, political and technological environment of the business organizations, especially quantitative techniques and communication skills. It also aims at developing students a wide appreciation of relevant subjects and of their importance in solving business problems. The undergraduate degree program maintains this extensive approach to business. There are formal final examinations in all courses and all activities carried out in the program are considered for overall assessment of students’ merit. A satisfactory record of class work will also be required at each stage for successful completion of BBA degree.",
        "hod_name": "Md. Zaber Hossain",
        "hod_designation": "Associate Professor & (MBA Program Coordinator)",
        "hod_photo": "/images/departments/mba/head-md-zaber-hossain.jpeg",
        "hod_message": "Master of Business Administration (MBA) program aims at providing modern and better education in business, preparing students as well-trained business professionals to meet the needs of the national and international business. Through this program, students will develop their ability to understand necessary techniques for dealing with the economic, social, political and technological environment of the business organizations, especially quantitative techniques and communication skills. It also aims at developing students a wide appreciation of relevant subjects and of their importance in solving business problems. The undergraduate degree program maintains this extensive approach to business. There are formal final examinations in all courses and all activities carried out in the program are considered for overall assessment of students’ merit. A satisfactory record of class work will also be required at each stage for successful completion of BBA degree."
